01:00:34.460 --> 01:00:36.750
Well, there's a lot more to do here in this city.

01:00:37.330 --> 01:00:38.850
I miss the beach.

01:00:39.400 --> 01:00:41.980
You miss the beach. You love Los Angeles.

01:00:42.570 --> 01:00:44.870
Maybe you'll come visit me there, you and your father.

01:00:45.310 --> 01:00:47.660
We'll take you up on that invitation at some point.

01:00:48.330 --> 01:00:50.190
We still got to get settled here first.

01:00:51.700 --> 01:00:52.720
Did you say you live by the ocean?

01:00:53.200 --> 01:00:55.090
Yeah, two blocks away in Santa Monica.

01:00:55.630 --> 01:00:57.210
You know, we talked about moving there.

01:00:57.510 --> 01:01:00.000
Did? My memory's gone.

01:01:02.720 --> 01:01:04.430
